{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05204","headline":"季冬送户部郎中使黔府选补 · 卢僎","name":"季冬送户部郎中使黔府选补","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"握镜均荒服，分衡得大同。\n徵贤一台上，补吏五谿中。\n雨露将天泽，文章播国风。\n汉庭睽直谅，楚峡望清通。\n马逐霜鸿渐，帆沿晓月空。\n还期凤池拜，照耀列星宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢僎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05204.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05204","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}